# Docker reads ONLY the ignore file at the build context root, and the image
# is built with `context: .` (see .github/workflows/ci.yml) so the ADR corpus
# at docs/decisions/ is in scope for apps/platform/Dockerfile.
#
# DO NOT add `docs` here. The Dockerfile copies `docs/decisions` into the
# app's priv/ so the ADR index is reachable inside the release image. An
# exclusion here makes that COPY copy nothing — silently, with a green build.

# Build artefacts
**/_build
**/deps
**/.elixir_ls
**/.fetch
**/*.beam
erl_crash.dump

# VCS
.git

# App-specific
apps/platform/priv/static/cache_manifest.json
apps/platform/test
apps/platform/doc

# Siblings that are in context now that the context is the repo root, and
# that the platform image has no use for.
audit
e2e
frontends
packages
node_modules
**/node_modules
